WEBVTT

00:09.143 --> 00:10.411
ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.444 --> 00:12.446
Kids:
AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
孩子们：
是的，是的，队长！

00:12.480 --> 00:13.814
I CAN'T HEAR YOU.
我听不到你说话。

00:13.847 --> 00:15.516
( louder ):
AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
（大声）：
是的，是的，队长！

00:15.549 --> 00:18.719
* OH...
* 哦...

00:18.752 --> 00:20.788
* WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:20.821 --> 00:22.790
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:22.823 --> 00:25.293
* ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE. *
* 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的。 *

00:25.326 --> 00:26.694
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:26.727 --> 00:29.097
* IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE BE
SOMETHING YOU WISH... *
*如果航海废话是
您想要的东西... *

00:29.130 --> 00:30.364
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:30.398 --> 00:33.134
* THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH. *
* 然后掉到甲板上
像鱼一样扑通扑通。 *

00:33.167 --> 00:34.768
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:34.802 --> 00:36.704
* READY?
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 准备好？
海绵宝宝！ *

00:36.737 --> 00:39.707
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:39.740 --> 00:40.741
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:40.774 --> 00:43.377
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:43.411 --> 00:45.713
( laughs heartily )
（会心地笑）

00:45.746 --> 00:49.217
[Captioning sponsored by THE
U.S. DEPARTMENT OF EDUCATION
( plays airy tune )
[字幕由THE赞助
美国教育部
（演奏轻快的曲调）

00:49.250 --> 00:50.718
and NICKELODEON]
和尼克频道]

01:11.739 --> 01:13.574
( sighs dreamily )
（如梦似幻地叹息）

01:17.245 --> 01:18.246
( gasps )
（喘气）

01:18.279 --> 01:19.747
( grunting )
（咕哝）

01:21.715 --> 01:22.883
( gasps )
（喘气）

01:22.916 --> 01:24.818
( grunting )
（咕哝）

01:24.852 --> 01:25.753
HMM.
唔。

01:32.360 --> 01:33.461
HMM...
唔...

01:33.494 --> 01:35.529
I JUST DON'T GET IT.
我就是不明白。

01:35.563 --> 01:38.332
IF A FREE SALAD BAR DOESN'T
BRING IN CUSTOMERS
如果免费沙拉吧没有
引进客户

01:38.366 --> 01:39.867
WHAT WILL?!
什么会？

01:39.900 --> 01:41.335
( humming tune )
（哼唱曲调）

01:41.369 --> 01:42.503
Krabs:
SQUIDWARD!
螃蟹：
章鱼哥！

01:42.536 --> 01:43.537
UH, UH, YES, SIR?
呃，呃，是的，先生？

01:43.571 --> 01:45.806
THERE'S GOING TO BE
SOME CHANGES AROUND HERE.
将会有
这里发生了一些变化。

01:47.841 --> 01:49.177
( gasps )
（喘气）

01:49.210 --> 01:50.311
A CUSTOMER!
一位顾客！

01:50.344 --> 01:52.513
WELCOME TO THE KRUSTY KRAB!
欢迎来到脆皮蟹！

01:54.448 --> 01:56.884
SPONGEBOB, CATER
TO HIS EVERY WHIM
海绵宝宝，迎合
随心所欲

01:56.917 --> 01:58.486
AND DON'T SCREW
THIS ONE UP.
并且不要拧紧
这是一个。

01:58.519 --> 02:00.221
AYE, AYE, SIR!
是，是，先生！

02:00.254 --> 02:01.589
WELCOME ABOARD,
SIR.
欢迎登机，
先生。

02:01.622 --> 02:04.425
HERE AT THE KRUSTY KRAB,
YOU ARE THE CAPTAIN
在 Krusty Krab 餐厅，
你是队长

02:04.458 --> 02:06.760
AND I AM YOUR CABIN BOY.
我是您的乘务员。

02:06.794 --> 02:08.596
YOU JUST SAY THE WORD
您只需说出一句话

02:08.629 --> 02:11.432
AND I WILL THROW
MYSELF IN THE BRIG.
我会扔
我自己在双桅船里。

02:11.465 --> 02:12.733
MAY I TAKE YOUR ORDER?
我可以接受您的订单吗？

02:12.766 --> 02:15.369
ALL I WANTED WAS CHANGE
FOR THE PAY PHONE.
我想要的只是改变
对于公用电话。

02:15.403 --> 02:17.505
AYE, AYE, SIR!
是，是，先生！

02:17.538 --> 02:19.207
"MONSIEUR'S CHANGEZ."
“先生的零钱。”

02:19.240 --> 02:21.909
THANKS.
谢谢。

02:21.942 --> 02:23.477
( laughs nervously )
（紧张地笑）

02:23.511 --> 02:24.778
HERE YOU GO.
干得好。

02:26.280 --> 02:27.248
( sniffs )
（嗅）

02:27.281 --> 02:28.282
( cash register rings )
（收银机响）

02:28.316 --> 02:29.883
YEAH!
是的！

02:31.485 --> 02:33.721
( penny clinks )
（便士叮当响）

02:33.754 --> 02:37.191
AS YOU MAY HAVE NOTICED,
PROFITS ARE WAY DOWN THIS MONTH.
您可能已经注意到，
本月利润大幅下降。

02:37.225 --> 02:39.627
WE NEED A GIMMICK
TO BRING IN CUSTOMERS.
我们需要一个噱头
引进客户。

02:39.660 --> 02:41.529
DO YOU LUBBERS HAVE ANY IDEAS?
你们有什么想法吗？

02:41.562 --> 02:46.367
I'VE GOT ONE-- A FREE PAIR
OF SOCKS WITH EVERY PURCHASE.
我有一个——免费的一对
每次购买都会赠送袜子。

02:46.400 --> 02:47.535
UH-UH.
呃-呃。

02:47.568 --> 02:51.772
OR MAYBE DOUBLE-PATTY
MIDNIGHT MADNESS!
或者也许是双肉饼
午夜疯狂！

02:51.805 --> 02:53.207
OH! OH! OH! OH! OH! OH!
哦！哦！哦！哦！哦！哦！

02:53.241 --> 02:54.475
I KNOW! I KNOW! I KNOW!
我知道！我知道！我知道！

02:54.508 --> 02:56.344
HOW ABOUT
"MOUTHFUL OF CLAMS" DAY?
怎么样
“满口蛤蜊”日？

02:56.377 --> 02:59.613
EVERYONE WHO SHOWS UP
WITH A MOUTHFUL OF CLAMS
每个出现的人
满口蛤蜊

02:59.647 --> 03:00.614
GETS A FREE DRINK.
获得一杯免费饮料。

03:00.648 --> 03:01.982
HUH? HUH?
嗯？嗯？

03:02.015 --> 03:03.584
WELL, UH... I WAS THINKING
嗯，呃...我在想

03:03.617 --> 03:07.655
MORE ALONG THE LINES
OF LIVE ENTERTAINMENT.
更多相关内容
现场娱乐表演。

03:07.688 --> 03:09.857
THAT'S IT-- A FLOOR SHOW!
就是这样——一场现场表演！

03:09.890 --> 03:12.726
NO, WAIT,
A TALENT SHOW
不，等等，
才艺表演

03:12.760 --> 03:15.229
WITH YOUR HOST-- ME!
与你的主人——我！

03:15.263 --> 03:17.598
OH, THIS IS
THE MOMENT I'VE...
哦，这是
那一刻我...

03:17.631 --> 03:21.569
I MEAN, WE'VE
BEEN DREAMING OF.
我的意思是，我们已经
一直梦想着。

03:21.602 --> 03:22.870
THINK OF IT,
MR. KRABS
想一想，
先生。蟹蟹

03:22.903 --> 03:25.339
YOU WILL BE
RESPONSIBLE FOR
BRINGING CULTURE
你会的
负责
带来文化

03:25.373 --> 03:26.674
INTO THIS
CULTURAL WASTELAND
进入这个
文化荒地

03:26.707 --> 03:28.442
WE CALL
BIKINI BOTTOM.
我们致电
比基尼下装。

03:28.476 --> 03:31.512
( quietly ):
AND NOT TO MENTION
THE MONEY.
（静静地）：
更不用说
钱。

03:31.545 --> 03:33.414
THE MONEY?
钱？

03:33.447 --> 03:34.982
AND I CAN SEE IT NOW.
我现在就能看到。

03:35.015 --> 03:38.652
YOUR DAUGHTER, PEARL--
HER NAME UP IN LIGHTS.
你的女儿，珀尔——
她的名字出现在灯光下。

03:38.686 --> 03:41.455
LITTLE PEARLIE-- A STAR?
小珍珠——明星？

03:41.489 --> 03:42.590
HOPPING CLAMS!
跳蛤！

03:42.623 --> 03:43.757
A TALENT SHOW!
才艺表演！

03:43.791 --> 03:44.792
I'M TALENTED!
我很有才华！

03:44.825 --> 03:46.494
I'D BETTER CALL THE FOLKS.
我最好打电话给人们。

03:46.527 --> 03:48.562
SQUIDWARD,
YOU'VE GOT A DEAL.
章鱼哥，
你已经达成协议了。

03:48.596 --> 03:51.865
MAKE MY LITTLE GIRL
A STAR.
做我的小女孩
一颗明星。

03:53.667 --> 03:56.470
HEY, SQUIDWARD, WHAT
TIME AM I GOING ON?
嘿，章鱼哥，什么
我现在继续吗？

03:56.504 --> 03:57.371
GOING ON WHAT?
正在进行什么？

03:57.405 --> 03:58.572
THE SHOW!
表演！

03:58.606 --> 04:00.374
WHEN AM I GOING ON THE SHOW?
我什么时候参加演出？

04:00.408 --> 04:01.675
I HAVE A GREAT ACT.
我有一个伟大的表演。

04:01.709 --> 04:05.245
WHAT TALENT COULD
YOU POSSIBLY POSSESS?
什么人才可以
您可能拥有吗？

04:07.648 --> 04:11.552
( blowing )
（吹）

04:15.689 --> 04:21.295
( shoes tapping )
（敲鞋）

04:21.329 --> 04:22.330
TA-DAH!
达达！

04:22.363 --> 04:24.698
( yawns )
（打哈欠）

04:24.732 --> 04:28.035
NO ONE, NOT EVEN YOUR PARENTS,
WOULD WANT TO SEE THAT.
没有人，甚至你的父母，
想看看。

04:29.837 --> 04:34.442
WHAT THE PEOPLE WANT IS CULTURE,
NOT DANCING BUBBLES.
人们想要的是文化，
不是跳舞的泡泡。

04:34.475 --> 04:35.643
OKAY, I GET IT.
好的，我明白了。

04:35.676 --> 04:36.810
DON'T WORRY, SQUIDWARD.
别担心，章鱼哥。

04:36.844 --> 04:39.880
I'M GOING TO COME UP WITH
THE MOST CULTURED ACT EVER!
我会想出
有史以来最有文化的行为！

04:39.913 --> 04:42.816
( sarcastically ):
I CAN HARDLY WAIT.
（讽刺地）：
我已经等不及了。

04:42.850 --> 04:47.321
PHEW! THE ONLY CULTURE THAT GUY
HAS IS IN HIS TENNIS SHOES.
唷！唯一有文化的人
穿着网球鞋。

04:47.355 --> 04:50.090
HA, HA! TENNIS SHOES-- HA, HA!
哈，哈！网球鞋——哈，哈！

04:50.123 --> 04:51.725
I CRACK MYSELF UP.
我快崩溃了。

04:51.759 --> 04:53.827
WE ARE LIVE
AT THE KRUSTY KRAB TALENT SHOW
我们还活着
蟹堡王才艺表演

04:53.861 --> 04:55.396
FEATURING THE
FINEST TALENT...
特色是
最优秀的人才...

04:57.030 --> 04:58.899
WOW! A FULL HOUSE.
哇！满座。

04:58.932 --> 05:00.834
( gasps ):
THERE'S MOM AND DAD.
（喘气）：
有爸爸妈妈。

05:00.868 --> 05:02.736
THEY ARE GOING
TO BE SO PROUD!
他们要走了
如此自豪！

05:02.770 --> 05:06.774
HELLO, I'M MR. KRABS,
AND I LIKE MONEY.
你好，我是先生。螃蟹，
我喜欢钱。

05:06.807 --> 05:07.441
I GOT TO GET READY.
我得做好准备。

05:07.475 --> 05:09.377
Squidward:
LISTEN UP, PEOPLE
章鱼哥：
听着，人们

05:09.410 --> 05:10.378
LISTEN UP.
听着。

05:10.411 --> 05:12.580
GATHER AROUND, EVERYONE.
大家聚集在一起。

05:12.613 --> 05:14.348
NOW, YOU MAY BE THINKING
现在，您可能在想

05:14.382 --> 05:16.884
THIS IS YOUR ONE SHOT
AT THE BIG TIME.
这是你的一击
重要时刻。

05:16.917 --> 05:18.686
WELL, IT'S NOT.
嗯，事实并非如此。

05:18.719 --> 05:20.454
IT'S MINE.
这是我的。

05:20.488 --> 05:24.124
HEY, SQUID,
HOW ABOUT THIS
FOR THE SHOW?
嘿，鱿鱼，
这个怎么样
为了演出？

05:24.157 --> 05:28.362
THE AMAZING MR. ABSORBENCY!
了不起的先生。吸水性！

05:28.396 --> 05:29.997
( sucking water )
（吸水）

05:32.165 --> 05:33.434
WHOA!
哇啊！

05:33.467 --> 05:34.835
TA-DAH!
达达！

05:35.803 --> 05:37.405
TA-DAH!
达达！

05:37.438 --> 05:40.974
NO ONE IS GOING
TO WANT TO SEE YOU
ENGORGE YOURSELF.
没有人会去
想见你
充实自己。

05:43.411 --> 05:45.646
PLEASE, SQUIDWARD,
LET ME BE IN THE SHOW.
请，章鱼哥，
让我参加演出。

05:45.679 --> 05:49.783
I'LL DO ANYTHING,
ANYTHING, ANYTHING!
我会做任何事，
任何事，任何事！

05:49.817 --> 05:51.785
SO, YOU REALLY WANT
TO BE IN THE SHOW?
所以，你真的想要
参加演出？

05:51.819 --> 05:53.020
OH, YES!
哦是的！

05:53.053 --> 05:55.723
OKAY, YOU GET TO
MOP UP AFTERWARDS.
好的，你可以了
之后清理。

05:55.756 --> 05:58.792
NOW, WILL YOU STOP
BUGGING ME?
现在，你能停下来吗？
打扰我？

05:58.826 --> 06:04.064
SO, THIS IS WHAT
IT FEELS LIKE-- THE BIG TIME.
所以，这就是什么
感觉就像——很重要的时刻。

06:04.097 --> 06:08.001
WITH THIS MOP,
I SHAPE MY DESTINY!
有了这个拖把，
我的命运由我决定！

06:08.035 --> 06:12.005
( applause )
（掌声）

06:12.039 --> 06:13.807
( clears throat )
（清嗓子）

06:13.841 --> 06:15.976
GOOD EVENING, AND WELCOME
晚上好，欢迎光临

06:16.009 --> 06:20.714
TO THE FIRST ANNUAL
SQUIDWARD TENTACLES TALENT SHOW
至第一届年度报告
章鱼哥触手才艺表演

06:20.748 --> 06:23.083
SPONSORED BY THE KRUSTY KRAB
由蟹堡王赞助

06:23.116 --> 06:25.453
HOME OF THE KRABBY PATTY
蟹黄饼之家

06:25.486 --> 06:27.788
BECAUSE NO ONE ELSE
WOULD GIVE IT A HOME.
因为没有其他人
会给它一个家。

06:27.821 --> 06:28.822
( rimshot; Patrick guffawing )
（边缘射击；帕特里克大笑）

06:28.856 --> 06:31.692
( laughing )
（笑）

06:31.725 --> 06:33.627
UH... THANK YOU.
呃……谢谢。

06:33.661 --> 06:39.166
OUR NEXT ACT IS LIVING PROOF
THAT NEPOTISM IS ALIVE AND WELL.
我们的下一步就是活生生的证明
这种裙带关系依然存在。

06:39.199 --> 06:44.738
( laughing uproariously )
（哈哈大笑）

06:44.772 --> 06:45.873
NEPOTI...
内波蒂...

06:45.906 --> 06:46.940
( laughing )
（笑）

06:46.974 --> 06:48.842
HA... THANK YOU.
哈...谢谢你。

06:48.876 --> 06:50.811
PUT YOUR FINS TOGETHER FOR...
将你的鳍放在一起......

06:50.844 --> 06:55.483
( laughing )
（笑）

06:55.516 --> 06:56.850
PUT YOUR...
把你的...

06:56.884 --> 06:59.119
( Patrick laughing )
（帕特里克大笑）

06:59.152 --> 07:00.120
PUT...
放...

07:00.153 --> 07:01.989
( Patrick laughing )
（帕特里克大笑）

07:02.022 --> 07:03.223
PEARL!
珍珠！

07:03.256 --> 07:05.158
HOORAY!
万岁！

07:07.060 --> 07:10.698
MY LITTLE GIRL IS
FINALLY A STAR!
我的小女儿是
终于成为明星了！

07:10.731 --> 07:12.232
GIVE ME A K-R-U...
给我一个 K-R-U...

07:12.265 --> 07:14.835
( Pearl pounds floor,
audience cries out )
（珍珠磅楼，
观众尖叫）

07:14.868 --> 07:17.070
GIVE ME A S-T-Y...
给我一个 S-T-Y...

07:17.104 --> 07:18.672
( crying out )
（哭喊）

07:18.706 --> 07:20.908
KRUSTY KRAB!
脆皮蟹！

07:20.941 --> 07:22.175
( crying out )
（哭喊）

07:22.209 --> 07:24.612
KRUSTY KRAB!
脆皮蟹！

07:24.645 --> 07:26.146
( crying out )
（哭喊）

07:26.179 --> 07:28.181
KRUSTY KRAB!!
脆皮蟹！！

07:28.215 --> 07:29.783
NOW, THAT'S
TALENT!
现在，那就是
人才！

07:29.817 --> 07:30.651
( loud crash )
（巨大的撞击声）

07:30.684 --> 07:32.486
THANK YOU!
谢谢你！

07:32.520 --> 07:34.822
MY LEGS!
我的腿！

07:34.855 --> 07:35.856
( audience groaning )
（观众呻吟）

07:35.889 --> 07:37.725
THANK YOU!
谢谢你！

07:37.758 --> 07:39.059
( giggling ):
THANK YOU.
（咯咯笑）：
谢谢。

07:40.828 --> 07:42.062
( yelps )
（尖叫声）

07:42.095 --> 07:44.532
HEY, SQUIDWARD, LISTEN,
WHAT DO YOU THINK?
嘿，章鱼哥，听着，
你觉得怎么样？

07:44.565 --> 07:45.533
WHEN I MOP
当我拖地时

07:45.566 --> 07:46.900
SHOULD I GO FORWARD
AND BACK?
我应该继续吗
然后回来？

07:46.934 --> 07:49.670
NO, NO, WAIT--
SIDE TO SIDE.
不，不，等等——
从一边到另一边。

07:49.703 --> 07:50.871
( crash )
（ 碰撞 ）

07:50.904 --> 07:54.107
AND NOW, POETRY...
现在，诗歌...

07:54.141 --> 07:56.910
BY... GARY.
作者：……加里。

07:56.944 --> 07:58.946
( clears throat )
（清嗓子）

07:58.979 --> 08:02.750
( meowing )
（喵喵叫）

08:02.783 --> 08:03.884
( sighs dreamily )
（如梦似幻地叹息）

08:03.917 --> 08:06.954
HE HAS SUCH A WAY
WITH WORDS.
他有这样的办法
用言语。

08:06.987 --> 08:08.255
( meowing slowly )
（慢慢地喵喵叫）

08:08.288 --> 08:10.023
COME ON, COME ON, GINSBERG.
来吧，来吧，金斯伯格。

08:10.057 --> 08:11.825
IF HE DOESN'T HURRY IT UP
如果他不快点的话

08:11.859 --> 08:14.528
WE'RE NOT GOING TO HAVE ENOUGH
TIME FOR THE BEST ACT-- ME!
我们还不够
最佳表演时间到了——我！

08:14.562 --> 08:19.733
SQUIDWARD, SHOULD I USE
MR. CLEANSER OR DR. CLEAN?
章鱼哥，我应该使用吗
先生。洁面乳或 DR.干净的？

08:19.767 --> 08:21.201
YES.
是的。

08:21.234 --> 08:23.771
( applause )
（掌声）

08:23.804 --> 08:26.974
I, THE AMAZING PLANKTON
我，神奇的浮游生物

08:27.007 --> 08:29.910
WITH THE USE OF PRESTIDIGITATION
使用预数字化

08:29.943 --> 08:34.948
WILL MAKE A KRABBY PATTY
DISAPPEAR BEFORE YOUR VERY EYES.
会做蟹肉饼
消失在你眼前。

08:34.982 --> 08:38.351
FIRST, I'LL NEED A VOLUNTEER
FROM THE AUDIENCE.
首先，我需要一名志愿者
来自观众。

08:42.222 --> 08:44.324
NICE TRY.
不错的尝试。

08:44.357 --> 08:46.126
YOUR ACT'S OVER, BUB.
你的行动结束了，巴布。

08:46.159 --> 08:49.229
YOU MAY WIN THIS TIME.
这次你可能会赢。

08:49.262 --> 08:50.998
SHEE-AH KAZING!
谢啊发笑！

08:53.601 --> 08:55.035
WELL, THIS STINKS.
嗯，这很臭。

08:55.068 --> 08:58.205
( audience booing )
（观众起哄）

08:58.238 --> 09:02.142
Audience:
GET OUT! GET OFF THE STAGE!
观众：
滚出去！下台！

09:02.175 --> 09:03.911
SQUIDWARD!
章鱼哥！

09:03.944 --> 09:05.613
THIS SHOW IS A DISASTER!
这个节目是一场灾难！

09:05.646 --> 09:06.880
YOU'RE RUINING ME!
你毁了我！

09:06.914 --> 09:09.282
NOW, NOW, DON'T YOU
WORRY, MR. KRABS.
现在，现在，你不
担心，先生。螃蟹。

09:09.316 --> 09:12.219
I'VE SAVED THE BEST
FOR LAST-- YOU'LL SEE.
我已经保存了最好的
最后——你会看到的。

09:12.252 --> 09:15.155
FOR YOUR SAKE,
I HOPE YOU'RE RIGHT.
为了您的缘故，
我希望你是对的。

09:15.188 --> 09:17.891
Squidward:
AND NOW, LADIES AND GENTLEMEN
章鱼哥：
现在，女士们、先生们

09:17.925 --> 09:20.661
THE MOMENT YOU'VE
ALL BEEN WAITING FOR.
你拥有的那一刻
一切都在等待。

09:20.694 --> 09:23.631
WE'VE SAVED THE BEST FOR LAST.
我们把最好的留到最后。

09:23.664 --> 09:29.970
PUT YOUR HANDS TOGETHER
FOR THE INCOMPARABLE SQUIDWARD!
双手合十
为了无与伦比的章鱼哥！

09:30.003 --> 09:38.378
( applause, horns playing
dramatic fanfare )
（掌声、喇叭声
戏剧性的宣传）

09:38.411 --> 09:43.884
( light orchestral melody
playing, bird chirping,
Squidward spurts rhythmically)
（轻快的管弦乐旋律
嬉戏、鸟鸣、
章鱼哥有节奏地喷射）

09:43.917 --> 09:50.824
( hard-driving
synthesized music playing,
Squidward gurgling )
（硬驾驶
合成音乐播放，
章鱼哥咕噜咕噜）

09:50.858 --> 09:52.092
WHAT THE...?
什么是...？

09:52.125 --> 09:53.961
( babbling rhythmically )
（有节奏地胡言乱语）

09:56.797 --> 09:58.999
( audience booing )
（观众起哄）

09:59.032 --> 10:01.935
I'M LOSING MONEY ON THIS DEAL.
我在这笔交易上亏钱了。

10:03.070 --> 10:05.372
IT'S WORTH EVERY PENNY.
每一分钱都值得。

10:05.405 --> 10:08.208
( booing )
（嘘声）

10:08.241 --> 10:10.711
YOU BOTTOM FEEDERS!
你们这些底层喂食者！

10:10.744 --> 10:13.080
YOU DON'T EVEN KNOW TALENT!
你连天赋都不知道！

10:13.113 --> 10:17.951
Audience ( chanting ):
NO TALENT! NO TALENT!
NO TALENT! NO TALENT!
观众（喊口号）：
没有天赋！没有天赋！
没有天赋！没有天赋！

10:17.985 --> 10:21.254
HEY, SQUIDWARD,
CAN I GO ON NOW?
嘿，章鱼哥，
我现在可以继续吗？

10:21.288 --> 10:23.657
YEAH, SHOW'S OVER.
是的，演出结束了。

10:23.691 --> 10:29.029
( booing continues )
（嘘声继续）

10:29.062 --> 10:29.963
( booing stops )
（嘘声停止）

10:29.997 --> 10:31.064
HEY, YEAH!
嘿，是啊！

10:31.098 --> 10:32.866
THAT'S REALLY
NOT TOO BAD.
确实如此
还不错。

10:32.900 --> 10:33.901
I LIKE THAT.
我喜欢这样。

10:33.934 --> 10:35.335
ALL RIGHT!
好的！

10:35.368 --> 10:39.106
( cheering and applause )
（欢呼和掌声）

10:39.139 --> 10:41.141
( cheering and applause stops )
（欢呼声和掌声停止）

10:41.174 --> 10:44.712
( loud cheering and applause )
（热烈的欢呼和掌声）

10:44.745 --> 10:46.947
THEY WANT AN ENCORE.
他们想要再来一次。

10:46.980 --> 10:50.183
STAND ASIDE, SPONGEBOB.
站到一边，海绵宝宝。

10:50.217 --> 10:51.919
( loud cheering )
（大声欢呼）

10:51.952 --> 10:53.420
( cheering stops )
（欢呼声停止）

10:55.155 --> 10:56.356
( groaning )
（呻吟）

10:59.827 --> 11:04.031
( loud cheering and applause )
（热烈的欢呼和掌声）

11:04.064 --> 11:05.866
( cheering stops )
（欢呼声停止）

11:09.803 --> 11:12.405
( cheering )
（欢呼）

11:12.439 --> 11:14.407
( cheering stops )
（欢呼声停止）

11:14.441 --> 11:16.409
( cheering )
（欢呼）

11:16.443 --> 11:17.477
( cheering stops )
（欢呼声停止）

11:17.510 --> 11:21.014
( cheering )
（欢呼）

11:21.048 --> 11:22.449
( cheering stops )
（欢呼声停止）

11:28.321 --> 11:33.861
( cheering )
（欢呼）

11:33.894 --> 11:35.295
YOU DID IT,
SQUIDWARD!
你做到了，
章鱼哥！

11:35.328 --> 11:37.898
WHAT A GREAT SHOW!
多棒的表演啊！

11:37.931 --> 11:39.733
OH, MY SON'S
A STAR.
哦，我儿子的
一颗明星。

11:39.767 --> 11:42.035
WHO EVER KNEW
HE HAD SUCH TALENT?
谁知道
他有这样的天赋？

11:42.069 --> 11:45.005
I'LL BE NEEDING
ANOTHER WHEELBARROW
我需要
另一辆独轮车

11:45.038 --> 11:47.007
FOR NEXT WEEK'S SHOW!
下周的演出！

11:47.040 --> 11:48.041
( groans )
（呻吟）

11:48.075 --> 11:49.409
( cheering )
（欢呼）

11:49.442 --> 11:51.011
( camera shutters clicking )
（相机快门咔哒声）

12:03.390 --> 12:06.293
Narrator ( in French accent ):
AH, THE KRUSTY KRAB--
旁白（法语口音）：
啊，脆皮蟹——

12:06.326 --> 12:09.029
EVERYONE ENJOYING
THEIR KRABBY PATTIES.
大家都在享受
他们的蟹肉饼。

12:09.062 --> 12:11.064
( screaming )
（尖叫）

12:11.098 --> 12:12.766
HUH?! WHAT'S THIS?
啊？！这是什么？

12:12.800 --> 12:15.068
( screaming continues )
（尖叫声继续）

12:20.440 --> 12:22.375
CAN YOU SPOT HER, MR. SQUIDWARD?
你能认出她吗，先生。章鱼哥？

12:22.409 --> 12:25.245
DOWN THERE, SIR!
在那儿，先生！

12:25.278 --> 12:29.149
THERE APPEARS TO BE A KRABBY
PATTY-NAPPING IN PROGRESS.
似乎有一只螃蟹
正在进行小睡。

12:30.550 --> 12:33.020
THERE CAN BE
ONLY ONE CULPRIT...
可能有
只有一个罪魁祸首...

12:33.053 --> 12:34.354
PLANKTON!
浮游生物！

12:34.387 --> 12:38.258
Plankton:
FINALLY, VICTORY IS MINE.
浮游生物：
最后，胜利属于我。

12:38.291 --> 12:39.893
I WIN, I WIN!
我赢了，我赢了！

12:39.927 --> 12:41.194
I WIN!
我赢了！

12:41.228 --> 12:42.195
( laughing )
（笑）

12:42.229 --> 12:43.997
HE GOT AWAY, SIR.
他走了，先生。

12:44.031 --> 12:46.166
NO!
不！

12:46.199 --> 12:49.302
HE'S FINALLY STOLEN
ME SECRET RECIPE.
他终于被偷了
我的秘密食谱。

12:49.336 --> 12:53.073
PERHAPS NOT, MONSIEUR KRABS,
FOR IT'S...
也许不是，蟹蟹先生，
因为它...

12:53.106 --> 12:55.843
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
海绵宝宝！

13:04.151 --> 13:05.485
AHA!
啊哈！

13:12.325 --> 13:13.326
HEY!
嘿！

13:23.403 --> 13:25.538
OKAY, THAT'S
FAR ENOUGH.
好的，就是这样
足够了。

13:25.572 --> 13:26.573
HUH?
嗯？

13:27.607 --> 13:29.209
TARTAR SAUCE!
鞑靼酱！

13:39.552 --> 13:41.955
YEE-HAW!
呀呀！

13:49.129 --> 13:50.998
HAVE YOU SEEN
A KRABBY PATTY?
你见过吗
蟹肉饼？

13:51.031 --> 13:52.599
IT'S ABOUT
THIS TALL, AND...
这是关于
这么高，而且……

13:54.101 --> 13:56.003
WOW, A MAGIC SHOP.
哇，一家神奇的商店。

13:56.036 --> 13:58.105
ARE YOU A MAGICIAN?
你是魔术师吗？

13:58.138 --> 14:00.073
ONE TIME
I SAW THIS MAGICIAN
一次
我看到了这个魔术师

14:00.107 --> 14:02.175
AND HE DID
THIS THING, AND...
他做到了
这件事，还有……

14:02.209 --> 14:04.044
ANYWAY, AND
THEN HE TOLD US
无论如何，并且
然后他告诉我们

14:04.077 --> 14:06.947
"IF YOU BELIEVE
IN YOURSELF
“如果你相信
就你自己而言

14:06.980 --> 14:10.117
"AND WITH A TINY
PINCH OF MAGIC
“还有一个小小的
魔法之捏

14:10.150 --> 14:13.520
ALL YOUR DREAMS
CAN COME TRUE."
你所有的梦想
可以实现。”

14:13.553 --> 14:15.222
( screams )
（尖叫声）

14:15.255 --> 14:17.124
I CAN'T TAKE IT!
我受不了！

14:17.157 --> 14:18.458
PLANKTON, IT'S YOU!
浮游生物，就是你！

14:18.491 --> 14:21.161
YES, AND AFTER ALL THESE YEARS
是的，经过这么多年

14:21.194 --> 14:24.331
I THOUGHT I WAS
THE MASTER OF TORTURE.
我以为我是
酷刑大师。

14:24.364 --> 14:27.434
BUT THAT. THAT
JUST WASN'T FAIR.
但是那样。那
这不公平。

14:27.467 --> 14:28.435
HERE!
这里！

14:28.468 --> 14:29.970
TAKE THE STUPID PATTY.
采取愚蠢的馅饼。

14:30.003 --> 14:33.106
I DON'T WANT
THE SECRET RECIPE ANYWAY.
我不想要
无论如何，秘密食谱。

14:33.140 --> 14:38.211
I GUESS MY RESTAURANT WILL NEVER
BE AS GOOD AS THE KRUSTY KRAB.
我想我的餐厅永远不会
和甲壳蟹一样出色。

14:38.245 --> 14:41.915
( crying ):
YOU DON'T KNOW WHAT
IT'S LIKE TO BE A LOSER.
（哭）：
你不知道什么
就像是一个失败者。

14:41.949 --> 14:44.084
( sobbing )
（抽泣）

14:44.117 --> 14:46.319
AW... CHEER UP,
PLANKTON.
哇...振作起来，
浮游生物。

14:46.353 --> 14:48.088
I THINK
YOU'RE A WINNER.
我认为
你是赢家。

14:48.121 --> 14:52.926
WHAT... WHAT DID YOU SAY?
什么...你说什么？

14:52.960 --> 14:54.161
I SAID YOU'RE A...
我说你是一个...

14:54.194 --> 14:56.229
Others:
LOSER!
其他：
失败者！

14:56.263 --> 14:57.130
HOW DOES IT FEEL
感觉如何

14:57.164 --> 14:58.531
TO BE THE MOST
HATED THING
成为最
讨厌的东西

14:58.565 --> 15:00.533
IN BIKINI BOTTOM,
PLANKTON?
穿着比基尼泳裤，
浮游生物？

15:00.567 --> 15:02.435
IT HURTS,
DOESN'T IT?
I KNOW.
很痛，
不是吗？
我知道。

15:02.469 --> 15:04.504
YEAH, AND FOR
RUNNING YOU OUT
是的，并且为了
耗尽你的精力

15:04.537 --> 15:06.373
WE'RE GOING
TO MAKE THIS KID
我们要去
为了培养这个孩子

15:06.406 --> 15:08.641
HONORARY TOWN ROOKIE
OF THE DAY.
荣誉镇新秀
当日。

15:08.675 --> 15:11.478
* FOR HE'S
A JOLLY GOOD ROOKIE *
* 为他
一个非常好的新秀 *

15:11.511 --> 15:14.147
* FOR HE'S A JOLLY GOOD ROOKIE
* 因为他是一个非常好的新秀

15:14.181 --> 15:19.619
* FOR HE'S
A JOLLY GOOD ROOKIE... *
* 为他
A JOLLY GOOD ROOKIE... *

15:19.652 --> 15:24.224
SpongeBob:
I BET IF HE HAD JUST ONE FRIEND
HE WOULDN'T BE SUCH A MEANIE.
海绵宝宝：
我打赌如果他只有一个朋友
他不会这么吝啬。

15:24.257 --> 15:28.228
( cheering )
（欢呼）

15:28.261 --> 15:30.663
* WHICH NOBODY... WHATEVER.
* 没有人...无论如何。

15:36.136 --> 15:37.270
( knock at door )
（敲门）

15:37.304 --> 15:38.571
A CUSTOMER?
客户？

15:39.672 --> 15:44.377
OUR SPECIAL TODAY
IS CHUM... BALAYA.
我们的特别今天
是密友……巴拉亚。

15:44.411 --> 15:45.345
HI, MR. PLANKTON.
嗨，先生。浮游生物。

15:45.378 --> 15:46.579
HAVEN'T YOU DEGRADED ME
你没有贬低我吗

15:46.613 --> 15:47.647
ENOUGH FOR ONE DAY?
一天够吗？

15:47.680 --> 15:48.648
NO.
不。

15:48.681 --> 15:50.083
I MEAN...
我是说...

15:50.117 --> 15:51.985
I WANT YOU
TO COME OUT
AND PLAY WITH ME.
我想要你
出来
和我一起玩。

15:52.019 --> 15:53.286
WHA...?
世界卫生大会...？

15:53.320 --> 15:56.523
PLAY... WITH... ME...
和我一起玩...

15:56.556 --> 15:59.426
YOU KNOW HOW TO INDUCE
THERMONUCLEAR FUSION?
你知道如何诱导
热核聚变？

15:59.459 --> 16:01.194
NO, BUT I LIKE TO GO...
不，但我喜欢去……

16:01.228 --> 16:03.630
THAT NAIVE CUBE!
那个天真的立方体！

16:03.663 --> 16:05.232
HOW LONG MUST I SUFFER THIS?
我必须忍受这种痛苦多久？

16:05.265 --> 16:08.035
Computer:
You're not letting him leave,
are you?
电脑：
你不让他离开
你是吗？

16:08.068 --> 16:09.436
Can't you see?
你看不到吗？

16:09.469 --> 16:12.039
This is the perfect
opportunity for revenge.
这是完美的
报仇的机会。

16:12.072 --> 16:13.040
ELABORATE.
精心制作的。

16:13.073 --> 16:15.042
Befriend the sponge bath
与海绵浴交朋友

16:15.075 --> 16:18.545
then, when the time is just
right, take the Krabby Patty!
然后，当时间正好
对了，吃蟹肉饼吧！

16:18.578 --> 16:21.581
TAKE... THE KRABBY PATTY.
拿……蟹肉饼。

16:21.614 --> 16:24.117
Get moving, genius,
don't let him get away!
行动起来，天才，
别让他跑了！

16:24.151 --> 16:26.219
...WITH MY FRIENDS
IN JELLYFISH FIELDS.
...和我的朋友们
在水母领域。

16:26.253 --> 16:29.789
ALL RIGHT, SPONGEBOB,
I'LL PLAY YOUR LITTLE GAME.
好吧，海绵宝宝，
我来玩你的小游戏。

16:29.822 --> 16:30.790
RIGHT!
正确的！

16:30.823 --> 16:32.325
LAST ONE TO THE FIELDS
最后一个到田野的人

16:32.359 --> 16:33.626
IS A ROTTEN CLAM!
是烂蛤蜊！

16:35.462 --> 16:37.397
SO, I GET THE BIG NET
所以，我得到了大网

16:37.430 --> 16:39.199
AND YOU GET
THE LITTLE NET.
你会得到
小网。

16:39.232 --> 16:41.234
WHAT HAPPENS AFTER WE EAT THEM?
我们吃掉它们后会发生什么？

16:41.268 --> 16:44.404
YOU DON'T EAT THEM,
YOU CATCH THEM, LIKE THIS.
你不吃它们，
你抓住他们，就像这样。

16:44.437 --> 16:46.773
* LA, LA, LA, LA-LA,
LA, LA, LA, LA-LA. *
* 洛杉矶，洛杉矶，洛杉矶，洛杉矶-洛杉矶，
洛杉矶，洛杉矶，洛杉矶，洛杉矶-洛杉矶。 *

16:46.806 --> 16:48.075
LIKE THAT.
就像这样。

16:48.108 --> 16:49.076
AND?
和？

16:49.109 --> 16:50.477
THEN YOU
THROW THEM BACK--
那么你
把它们扔回去——

16:50.510 --> 16:51.544
WATCH OUT FOR STINGERS.
小心毒刺。

16:51.578 --> 16:53.446
STINGERS?
毒刺？

16:53.480 --> 16:57.484
( screaming )
（尖叫）

16:57.517 --> 17:01.821
ALL KNEES WILL BOW TO PLANKTON.
所有的膝盖都会屈服于浮游生物。

17:01.854 --> 17:03.390
HAIL, PLANKTON!
冰雹，浮游生物！

17:03.423 --> 17:05.692
I WIN, I WIN!
我赢了，我赢了！

17:05.725 --> 17:08.761
IT'S NOT ABOUT WINNING,
IT'S ABOUT FUN.
这不是为了赢，
这就是乐趣。

17:08.795 --> 17:10.763
WHAT'S THAT?
那是什么？

17:10.797 --> 17:13.166
FUN IS WHEN YOU...
有趣的是当你...

17:13.200 --> 17:14.634
FUN IS...
乐趣在于...

17:14.667 --> 17:15.768
IT'S LIKE...
这就像...

17:15.802 --> 17:17.337
IT'S KIND OF...
这有点...

17:17.370 --> 17:19.072
SORT OF LIKE A...
有点像...

17:19.106 --> 17:21.274
WHAT IS FUN?
有什么乐趣？

17:21.308 --> 17:23.376
LET ME SPELL IT FOR YOU:
让我为您拼写一下：

17:23.410 --> 17:26.179
* "F" IS FOR FRIENDS
WHO DO STUFF TOGETHER *
*“F”是给朋友的
谁一起做事 *

17:26.213 --> 17:29.249
* "U" IS FOR YOU AND ME
* “U”代表你和我

17:29.282 --> 17:31.751
* "N" IS FOR ANYWHERE
AND ANYTIME AT ALL *
*“N”代表任何地方
并且随时 *

17:31.784 --> 17:35.188
All:
* DOWN HERE
IN THE DEEP BLUE SEA. *
全部：
* 在这里
在深蓝色的大海中。 *

17:35.222 --> 17:38.325
* "F" IS FIRE THAT
BURNS DOWN THE WHOLE TOWN. *
*“F”是火
烧毁了整个城镇。 *

17:38.358 --> 17:41.361
* "U" IS FOR
URANIUM... BOMBS *
*“U”是为了
铀...炸弹*

17:41.394 --> 17:44.697
* "N" IS FOR NO SURVIVORS
WHEN YOU... *
*“N”代表无幸存者
当你... *

17:44.731 --> 17:48.401
PLANKTON, THOSE THINGS
AREN'T WHAT FUN
IS ALL ABOUT.
浮游生物，那些东西
没什么好玩的
就是这样。

17:48.435 --> 17:50.637
NOW, DO IT LIKE THIS:
现在，像这样：

17:50.670 --> 17:52.239
* "F" IS FOR FRIENDS WHO...
*“F”适合那些...的朋友

17:52.272 --> 17:53.440
NEVER!
绝不！

17:53.473 --> 17:55.408
THAT'S COMPLETELY IDIOTIC.
这完全是白痴。

17:55.442 --> 17:57.444
HERE, LET ME
HELP YOU.
在这里，让我
帮助你。

17:57.477 --> 18:00.513
* "F" IS FOR FRIENDS
WHO DO STUFF TOGETHER *
*“F”是给朋友的
谁一起做事 *

18:00.547 --> 18:01.848
* "U" IS FOR
YOU AND ME... *
*“U”是为了
你和我... *

18:01.881 --> 18:03.616
TRY IT!
尝试一下！

18:03.650 --> 18:06.553
* "N" IS FOR ANYWHERE
AND ANYTIME AT ALL *
*“N”代表任何地方
并且随时 *

18:06.586 --> 18:09.356
* DOWN HERE
IN THE DEEP BLUE SEA. *
* 在这里
在深蓝色的大海中。 *

18:09.389 --> 18:11.558
WAIT, I DON'T
UNDERSTAND THIS--
等等，我不
明白这一点——

18:11.591 --> 18:13.293
I FEEL ALL TINGLY INSIDE.
我感到内心一阵刺痛。

18:13.326 --> 18:15.428
SHOULD WE STOP?
我们应该停下来吗？

18:15.462 --> 18:18.365
NO, THAT'S HOW YOU'RE
SUPPOSED TO FEEL.
不，你就是这样的
应该感觉。

18:18.398 --> 18:20.867
WELL, I LIKE IT--
LET'S DO IT AGAIN!
嗯，我喜欢——
让我们再做一次！

18:20.900 --> 18:22.569
SpongeBob:
OKAY!
海绵宝宝：
好的！

18:22.602 --> 18:25.238
Both:
* "F" IS FOR FROLIC
THROUGH ALL THE FLOWERS *
两者：
*“F”代表嬉戏
穿过所有的花朵*

18:25.272 --> 18:28.308
* "U" IS FOR UKULELE
* “U”代表尤克里里琴

18:28.341 --> 18:31.478
* "N" IS FOR NOSE PICKING,
SHARING GUM AND SAND LICKING *
*“N”代表挖鼻孔，
共享口香糖和舔沙*

18:31.511 --> 18:34.314
* HERE WITH MY BEST BUDDY.
* 和我最好的朋友在一起。

18:34.347 --> 18:36.783
( both laughing in time
with music )
（两人及时笑了起来
有音乐）

18:43.656 --> 18:45.692
ARGH... MUTINY.
啊……叛变。

18:47.494 --> 18:48.461
Plankton:
AND AFTER THAT
浮游生物：
之后

18:48.495 --> 18:51.398
WE FROLICKED THROUGH THE FLOWERS
AND THEN WE...
我们在花丛中嬉戏
然后我们...

18:51.431 --> 18:52.799
Sounds like fun.
听起来很有趣。

18:52.832 --> 18:54.734
THE REALLY FUN PART
WAS WHEN WE...
真正有趣的部分
当我们...

18:54.767 --> 18:56.369
Where's the Krabby Patty?
蟹黄饼在哪里？

18:56.403 --> 18:57.570
UH, THE WHAT?
呃，什么？

18:57.604 --> 18:59.506
The Krabby Patty, remember?
蟹黄饼，还记得吗？

18:59.539 --> 19:01.708
YOU CAN'T RUSH
THESE THINGS, YOU KNOW.
你不能着急
这些事情，你知道。

19:01.741 --> 19:03.576
Remember the mission.
牢记使命。

19:03.610 --> 19:04.611
WHAT DO YOU MEAN?
你是什​​么意思？

19:04.644 --> 19:06.313
You're going native.
你要本土化了

19:06.346 --> 19:07.414
Look at yourself.
看看你自己。

19:07.447 --> 19:08.715
WHAT?
什么？

19:11.451 --> 19:13.620
I HAVEN'T SEEN PLANKTON
FOR A WHILE.
我还没见过浮游生物
有一段时间了。

19:13.653 --> 19:15.555
HE MUST BE SCHEMING.
他肯定是有阴谋的。

19:15.588 --> 19:17.457
WHO KNOWS? MAYBE HE'S CHANGED.
谁知道？也许他变了。

19:17.490 --> 19:18.625
WHO KNOWS?
谁知道？

19:18.658 --> 19:20.660
I THINK YOU KNOW!
我想你知道！

19:22.262 --> 19:23.830
HE'S CHANGED, I TELL YOU.
我告诉你，他变了。

19:23.863 --> 19:25.765
SPONGE BUDDY?
海绵伙伴？

19:25.798 --> 19:27.200
YOO-HOO!
哟吼！

19:27.234 --> 19:29.236
PLANKTON BUDDY, LET'S GO.
浮游生物伙伴，我们走吧。

19:29.269 --> 19:31.838
I FORGOT THIS IS
A NO-FRIENDS ZONE.
我忘了这是
无朋友区。

19:31.871 --> 19:33.906
SPONGEBOB...
海绵宝宝...

19:33.940 --> 19:36.609
MAY I SPEAK
TO YOU IN PRIVATE?
我可以发言吗
私下给你吗？

19:36.643 --> 19:39.946
YOU WON'T MIND IF I SET
THIS HERE, WILL YOU?
你不会介意我设置的
就在这里，你愿意吗？

19:42.382 --> 19:43.916
WHAT'S THIS ALL
ABOUT, MR. KRABS?
这是什么？
关于，先生。螃蟹？

19:43.950 --> 19:45.285
HE'S A THIEF--
他是个小偷——

19:45.318 --> 19:47.354
LOOK AT THE LUST
IN HIS EYE, HE'S...
看看欲望
在他眼里，他是……

19:47.387 --> 19:49.689
WHY CAN'T YOU
JUST ACCEPT OUR
FRIENDSHIP?
你为什么不能
只要接受我们的
友谊？

19:49.722 --> 19:51.224
HE'S JUST AFTER ME RECIPE.
他正在追寻我的食谱。

19:51.258 --> 19:52.292
I'LL PROVE IT TO YOU.
我会向你证明这一点。

19:53.393 --> 19:55.495
ARGH, YOU MUST
BE HUNGRY
啊啊，你必须
饥饿

19:55.528 --> 19:57.497
AFTER THAT LONG
WALK OVER HERE.
过了那么久
走到这里。

19:57.530 --> 19:59.932
OH, YES, BUT I'M SAVING
MY APPETITE
哦，是的，但我正在存钱
我的胃口

19:59.966 --> 20:02.402
FOR SOME POPCORN AT THE MOVIES.
看电影时吃点爆米花。

20:02.435 --> 20:04.504
UH... SUIT YOURSELF.
呃...适合你自己。

20:08.508 --> 20:09.776
WE'VE HAD ENOUGH
我们已经受够了

20:09.809 --> 20:11.678
OF YOUR LITTLE TESTS,
MR. KRABS.
你的小测试，
先生。螃蟹。

20:11.711 --> 20:14.314
COME ON, PLANKTON,
LET'S GET OUT OF HERE.
来吧，浮游生物，
我们离开这里吧。

20:14.347 --> 20:15.782
MAYBE THE LAD
WAS RIGHT.
也许是那个小伙子
是对的。

20:15.815 --> 20:17.550
MAYBE PLANKTON'S GONE STRAIGHT.
也许浮游生物已经消失了。

20:19.752 --> 20:21.854
AND MAYBE SCALLOPS
WILL FLY OUT OF MY PANTS!
也许还有扇贝
会从我的裤子里飞出来！

20:21.888 --> 20:24.757
HANG ON THERE, LADDIE,
I'M A-COMIN'!
坚持住，莱迪，
我来了！

20:25.892 --> 20:27.694
( movie soundtrack playing )
（电影原声播放）

20:36.603 --> 20:38.271
( squishing )
（压扁）

20:38.305 --> 20:40.707
I SURE LIKE
SEQUELS, PLANKTON.
我当然喜欢
续集，浮游生物。

20:40.740 --> 20:43.710
HEY, BUBBLE BASS,
YOU'RE SITTING ON MY FRIEND.
嘿，泡泡鲈鱼，
你坐在我朋友身上。

20:43.743 --> 20:45.745
( squishing )
（压扁）

20:45.778 --> 20:48.515
HEY, BUBBLE BASS...
嘿，泡泡贝斯...

20:49.982 --> 20:51.851
THANKS FOR THAT,
FRIEND.
谢谢你，
朋友。

20:51.884 --> 20:52.885
SURE THING.
当然可以。

20:52.919 --> 20:53.920
Krabs:
LISTEN UP!
螃蟹：
听着！

20:55.054 --> 20:56.723
MR. KRABS?
先生。螃蟹？

20:56.756 --> 20:58.325
HE'S DECEIVING YOU!
他在欺骗你！

20:58.358 --> 21:02.362
REACH INTO HIS POCKET NOW
AND TAKE WHAT HE'S GOT!
现在就把手伸进他的口袋里
并接受他所拥有的！

21:05.097 --> 21:06.999
YOU, TOO, BOY!
你也一样，孩子！

21:07.734 --> 21:09.536
( gasps )
（喘气）

21:09.569 --> 21:11.404
I CAN'T BELIEVE THIS.
我不敢相信这一点。

21:11.438 --> 21:12.539
IT'S NOT WHAT YOU THINK.
这不是你想的那样。

21:12.572 --> 21:13.973
WHAT IS IT, THEN?
那它是什么？

21:14.006 --> 21:15.975
TELL ME WHAT
YOU SEE HERE.
告诉我什么
你看这里。

21:16.008 --> 21:17.810
I... I DON'T
SEE ANYTHING.
我...我不
看到任何东西。

21:17.844 --> 21:20.580
( sobbing ):
HOW CAN YOU NOT SEE IT?
（抽泣）：
你怎么看不到它？

21:20.613 --> 21:22.849
OKAY, OKAY, I SEE IT.
好吧，好吧，我明白了。

21:22.882 --> 21:25.952
IT'S A KRABBY PATTY, OKAY?
这是蟹肉饼，好吗？

21:25.985 --> 21:28.421
I COULDN'T HELP IT.
我情不自禁。

21:28.455 --> 21:30.557
BUT WE SANG
THE FUN SONG.
但我们唱歌
有趣的歌曲。

21:30.590 --> 21:32.892
I THINK I'M GOING
TO BE SICK.
我想我要走了
生病了。

21:32.925 --> 21:34.427
HOW LONG?
多长时间？

21:34.461 --> 21:35.962
HOW LONG WHAT?
多久什么？

21:35.995 --> 21:38.665
HOW LONG WERE YOU
PLANNING ON DOING THIS?!
你多久了
计划这样做？！

21:40.467 --> 21:41.801
TELL ME!
告诉我！

21:41.834 --> 21:43.770
( crying )
（哭）

21:43.803 --> 21:44.704
WHAT?!
什么？！

21:44.737 --> 21:47.039
ALL RIGHT, IT'S TRUE!
好吧，这是真的！

21:47.073 --> 21:50.042
I TRICKED YOU
TO GET THE KRABBY PATTY!
我欺骗了你
去吃蟹肉饼吧！

21:50.076 --> 21:52.879
BUT THEN YOU SHOWED ME
FRIENDSHIP...
但后来你向我展示了
友谊...

21:52.912 --> 21:57.417
AND NOW I REALIZE...
现在我意识到...

21:57.450 --> 21:58.951
THAT'S ALL I EVER
REALLY WANTED.
这就是我的全部
真的想要。

21:58.985 --> 22:01.120
REALLY?
真的吗？

22:01.153 --> 22:02.655
NO, NOT REALLY.
不，不是真的。

22:02.689 --> 22:04.357
BEING EVIL IS TOO MUCH FUN!
作恶太有趣了！

22:04.391 --> 22:07.694
Oh, darling, I knew
nothing would ever
tear us apart.
哦，亲爱的，我知道
没有什么会永远
将我们分开。

22:07.727 --> 22:08.528
( ripping )
（撕裂）

22:10.830 --> 22:12.999
MR. KRABS, HE'S GONE.
先生。蟹蟹，他走了。

22:13.032 --> 22:14.801
HE GOT THE PATTY.
他得到了肉饼。

22:14.834 --> 22:16.803
HE WON.
他赢了。

22:16.836 --> 22:19.639
HO-HO, NO,
HE DIDN'T, BOY!
嗬嗬，不，
他没有，孩子！

22:19.672 --> 22:21.841
DON'T YOU KNOW WHAT'S
BEHIND THESE SCREENS?
你不知道是什么吗
在这些屏幕后面？

22:21.874 --> 22:23.510
SOLID CONCRETE!
坚固的混凝土！

22:23.543 --> 22:25.011
( laughing )
（笑）

22:25.044 --> 22:27.547
( groaning )
（呻吟）

22:27.580 --> 22:29.782
I'M SORRY,
MR. KRABS
对不起，
先生。蟹蟹

22:29.816 --> 22:31.851
I THOUGHT PLANKTON
HAD CHANGED.
我以为是浮游生物
已经改变了。

22:31.884 --> 22:33.553
DON'T BLAME HIM, LAD.
别怪他，小伙子。

22:33.586 --> 22:35.021
NO FRIENDSHIP
CAN WITHSTAND
没有友谊
可以承受

22:35.054 --> 22:37.690
THE ALLURE OF
A KRABBY PATTY.
的魅力
蟹肉饼。

22:37.724 --> 22:40.427
NOW, LET'S GO BACK
TO THE KRUSTY KRAB
现在，我们回去吧
去脆皮蟹

22:40.460 --> 22:42.695
AND HAVE A FRESH ONE,
ON ME!
并拥有一份新鲜的，
在我身上！

22:42.729 --> 22:44.030
AYE, AYE, MR. KRABS.
是的，是的，先生。螃蟹。

22:44.063 --> 22:45.665
WELL, MAYBE
AT A DISCOUNT.
嗯，也许吧
打折。

22:48.968 --> 22:50.737
HUH?
嗯？

22:50.770 --> 22:53.973
( screaming )
（尖叫）

22:58.611 --> 23:00.713
